  "close_observation_max_age_s": 300,
  "rules": [
    "Acknowledge and work-order closure never clear an equipment alarm or send a command.",
    "Imported snapshots and historical CSV are not a live acquisition channel.",
    "Plant plus NCU plus exact slave is an operational locator, not a persistent hardware identity.",
    "Diagnostic incident closure requires an unambiguous, time-anchored, recent OK observation and an intervention note.",
    "Missing data, ambiguous timestamps or conflicting locators must remain unknown.",
    "Operational changes require an applicability review and paired implementation/evidence in SCADA online and Toolbox."
  ],
